# Local deltas to relay's vendored configuration, applied by vendor-sync
# after the copy. Every hunk here does the same thing: it turns a path that
# upstream hardcodes to Debian's layout into a template variable, so cmrelay
# can point it at a Nix store path or at its own tree. Nothing changes what
# a directive means.
#
# vendor/ is generated output. A change belongs here, never there.

nginx-store-paths.patch
postfix-store-paths.patch
dovecot-store-paths.patch
opendkim-trust-anchor.patch
